Source: diskquota
Maintainer: Greengage <greengage@greengagedb.org>
Section: database
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13),
	 cmake,
	 lsb-release,
	 greengage@GP_MAJORVERSION@

Package: greengage@GP_MAJORVERSION@-diskquota
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
	 greengage@GP_MAJORVERSION@
Provides: diskquota, diskquota@GP_MAJORVERSION@
Replaces: diskquota, diskquota@GP_MAJORVERSION@
Description: Diskquota extension for Greengage@GP_MAJORVERSION@
	Diskquota is an extension that provides disk usage enforcement for
	database objects in Greengage DB. It supports setting quota limits on
	schemas and roles and limiting the amount of disk space they can use.
